-jxzhlk"/><!----> <!--[--><div class="faq-item svelte-1koe52u"><div class="accordion-item svelte-1rwoi5h"><details class="svelte-1rwoi5h"><summary title="What is Unharvest?" class="svelte-1rwoi5h"><div class="title t-secondary line-clamp-2 desktop-default-semibold svelte-1rwoi5h">What is Unharvest?</div> <!----><button tabindex="-1" class="button kind--outlined size--tiny icon-only icon-end svelte-na4a2u" aria-busy="false" data-sveltekit-reload="true"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[1--><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><!----><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12.566 15.316a.8.8 0 0 1-1.132 0l-5.5-5.5a.8.8 0 1 1 1.132-1.132L12 13.62l4.934-4.935a.8.8 0 1 1 1.132 1.132z" clip-rule="evenodd"/><!----></svg><!--]--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></summary> <div class="content desktop-default-regular t-secondary svelte-1koe52u"><!----><strong>Unharvest</strong> is a single-player reverse-farming incremental game from developer SkorpionDev. Instead of growing crops, you spread plagues and drain life from the world around you, upgrading how far, how fast, and how widely the decay spreads.<!----></div> <a href="https://www.unharvest.site/" target="_self" class="svelte-14r20fy"><div class="site-name-wrapper svelte-on1hvy"><div class="favicon-wrapper svelte-on1hvy"><!--[0--><div class="favicon-background-wrapper svelte-on1hvy"><img class="favicon-background svelte-on1hvy" src="https://imgs.search.brave.com/m8YOuhnQYOwaUCMPKSR908Dbq8AUqNsuBvfbQiX79Ao/rs:fit:32:32:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cDovL2Zhdmlj/b25zLnNlYXJjaC5i/cmF2ZS5jb20vaWNv/bnMvZjhmZTQ3Yzdm/NWY2Y2IxNTVkYzMx/NDg1Y2JkMGI0YmI5/MTQ5MmQ0MzVlYzY4/YWY0MDM4NTc3YjQ0/NDA5YjdmNS93d3cu/dW5oYXJ2ZXN0LnNp/dGUv" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-hidden="true"/></div><!--]--> <img src="https://imgs.search.brave.com/m8YOuhnQYOwaUCMPKSR908Dbq8AUqNsuBvfbQiX79Ao/rs:fit:32:32:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cDovL2Zhdmlj/b25zLnNlYXJjaC5i/cmF2ZS5jb20vaWNv/bnMvZjhmZTQ3Yzdm/NWY2Y2I