/app/5165160/Unharvest_Demo/",full_title:void 0,description:"Steam Leaderboards · Languages: English and 12 more · See all 13 supported languages · Title: Unharvest Demo Genre: Casual, Simulation · Developer: SkorpionDev · Publisher: SkorpionDev Release Date: Oct 7, 2026 · Visit the website YouTube Discord Instagram X View discussions Find Community Groups ·",page_age:"2026-10-23T01:13:54",profile:{name:"Steam",long_name:"store.steampowered.com"},language:"en",type:"search_result",subtype:"generic",is_live:false,deep_results:void 0,meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"store.steampowered.com",hostname:"store.steampowered.com",favicon:d,path:"› app  › 5165160  › Unharvest_Demo"},thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/xQZqx9KDEI5N538ibe-_b55VCLbTzeRubCM0eCEGAgQ/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9zaGFy/ZWQuZmFzdGx5LnN0/ZWFtc3RhdGljLmNv/bS9zdG9yZV9pdGVt/X2Fzc2V0cy9zdGVh/bS9hcHBzLzUxNjUx/NjAvNWUxNWQxMmRj/MDQ0MzA3ODgxZTg2/ZTI2ZmE3ZDQ5YWMz/ZjVkMWUzYy9jYXBz/dWxlXzYxNngzNTMu/anBnP3Q9MTc5Mjc0/NTY2OA",original:"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5165160/5e15d12dc044307881e86e26fa7d49ac3f5d1e3c/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792745668",logo:false,is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},age:"1 week ago",locations:void 0,video:void 0,movie:void 0,faq:void 0,recipe:void 0,qa:void 0,book:void 0,rating:void 0,article:void 0,product:void 0,product_cluster:void 0,cluster_type:void 0,cluster:void 0,similar_pages:void 0,creative_work:void 0,music_recording:void 0,review:void 0,software:void 0,content_type:void 0,side:void 0,descriptionLength:179},{title:"Unharvest – Indie Game Press Kit | IMPRESS",url:"https://impress.games/press-kit/skorpiondev/unharvest",full_title:void 0,description:"Unharvest is the second game from SkorpionDev, a solo developer in Casablanca, Morocco, after the physics platformer I Am Coin. The \u003Cstrong>free demo released on Steam in October 2026\u003C/strong> and passed 1,000 wishlists in its first two days.",page_age:void 0,profile:{name:"IMPRESS",long_name:"impress.games"},language:"en",type:"search_result",subtype:"generic",is_live:false,deep_results:void 0,meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"impress.games",hostname:"impress.games",favicon:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/Mh5GdLCE7itM6y-bYI5bHtOMtT8DsSlj0T4RNeVDnug/rs:fit:32:32:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cDovL2Zhdmlj/b25zLnNlYXJjaC5i/cmF2ZS5jb20vaWNv/bnMvY2NjZDhlNWM5/MmMyZGYwY2QzNTJi/MTMyOGNjYWEzZWEz/YjczYjRiMWQwZDZh/NmYyMTAxOThlZDE1/ZDY4ZWIwNS9pbXBy/ZXNzLmdhbWVzLw",path:"› press-kit  › skorpiondev  › unharvest"},thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/x-WVDwAjOKkAHW7w2iBObsiYQ6jUIYAqx-CMSJrfrrA/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9jZG4u/aW1wcmVzcy5nYW1l/cy9wcmVzc2tpdHMv/NGRiMjZiMzc4NTM5/MDRkM2NmYTZlYjVi/MWNlODkyOTEvc2Ny/ZWVuc2hvdHMvOC5w/bmc_dD0xNzkxNjc2/NDQ1MjY0",original:"https://cdn.impress.games/presskits/4db26b37853904d3cfa6eb5b1ce89291/screenshots/8.png?t=1791676445264",logo:false,is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},age:void 0,locations:void 0,video:void 0,movie:void 0,faq:void 0,recipe:void 0,qa:void 0,book:void 0,rating:void 0,article:void 0,product:void 0,product_cluster:void 0,cluster_type:void 0,cluster:void 0,similar_pages:void 0,creative_work:void 0,music_recording:void 0,review:void 0,software:void 0,content_type:void 0,side:void 0,descriptionLength:225},{title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",full_title:void 0,description:"Explore the free Unharvest demo on Steam, including plague upgrades, October updates, PC requirements, and what to know before downloading.",page_age:"2026-10-07T00:00:00",profile:{name:"Unharvest Wiki",long_name:"unharvest.site"},language:"en",type:"search_result",subtype:"faq",is_live:false,deep_results:void 0,meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""},thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/l5osACrCHtXBuP2SyzIu8ifWzXrkSyFL6I7NgCE3E0w/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cu/dW5oYXJ2ZXN0LnNp/dGUvaW1hZ2VzL2hl/cm8ud2VicA",original:"https://www.unharvest.site/images/hero.webp",logo:false,is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:false},age:"3 weeks ago",locations:void 0,video:{thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/ELQj3o6NMcICbEste4uxI7IFwtcKHMUXk818eBfQEP0/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnl0/aW1nLmNvbS92aS9C/Ynd0eWdfYkFkVS9t/YXhyZXNkZWZhdWx0/LmpwZw",original:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Bbwtyg_bAdU/maxresdefault.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true}},movie:void 0,faq:{items:[{question:"What is Unharvest?",answer:"Unharvest is a single-player reverse-farming incremental game from developer SkorpionDev. Instead of growing crops, you spread plagues and drain life from the world around you, upgrading how far, how fast, and how widely the decay spreads.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"Is there a free Unharvest demo?",answer:"Yes. Unharvest Demo launched on Steam on October 7, 2026 as a free download with its own store page. It is the only publicly playable version of Unharvest right now.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"When does Unharvest release?",answer:"Steam lists December 7, 2026 as the planned release date for the full version of Unharvest. The full game is not yet available, but it can be added to a Steam wishlist.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"What platforms is Unharvest on?",answer:"Unharvest is a Windows PC game distributed through Steam. Both the full game and the Unharvest demo are single-player experiences with Steam Achievements, Steam Cloud, and leaderboards.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"How do Unharvest plague upgrades work?",answer:"The official Unharvest description confirms plague upgrades grouped around spreading, speed, and reach. You improve those three areas to affect more of the environment as the world visibly and audibly withers.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"Will Unharvest run on my PC?",answer:"Unharvest lists Windows 10 as its minimum operating system and Windows 11 as recommended on Steam. Installing the free Unharvest demo from its own Steam page is the quickest way to see how the game runs on your machine.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}}]},recipe:void 0,qa:void 0,book:void 0,rating:void 0,article:void 0,product:void 0,product_cluster:void 0,cluster_type:void 0,cluster:void 0,similar_pages:void 0,creative_work:void 0,music_recording:void 0,review:void 0,software:void 0,content_type:void 0,side:void 0,descriptionLength:228,organization:{type:"organization",name:"Unharvest Wiki",url:void 0,thumbnail:void 0,contactPoints:[]}},{title:"Steam Community :: Unharvest",url:"https://steamcommunity.com/app/5138990",full_title:void 0,description:"Unharvest just passed 25,000 wishlists in less than 10 days, the demo is part of Steam Next Fest, and it&#x27;s close to 150 reviews.",page_age:void 0,profile:{name:"Steam Community",long_name:"steamcommunity.com"},language:"en",type:"search_result",subtype:"generic",is_live:false,deep_results:void 0,meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"steamcommunity.com",hostname:"steamcommunity.com",favicon:"https://imgs.search.brav