:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"What are the minimum PC requirements for Unharvest?",answer:"At minimum, Unharvest needs .",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Does Unharvest have controller support?",answer:"Yes. Steam lists full controller support for Unharvest.",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Can you play Unharvest on Mac?",answer:"Steam does not sell a macOS version of Unharvest; the Steam release is for Windows.",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Is Unharvest on Linux?",answer:"Steam does not list a native Linux version of Unharvest. Windows games can often run on Linux and Steam Deck through Proton, but that is a different question from native support.",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Does Unharvest have Denuvo?",answer:"Steam's store page lists no third-party DRM for Unharvest. That is what Steam shows, not a test of the game.",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Does Unharvest need a third-party account?",answer:"Steam's store page lists no third-party account requirement for Unharvest.",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}},{question:"Is Unharvest available in Germany?",answer:"Steam shows it to German users with an age rating of 6 (a rating Steam generated, not a USK certificate).",title:"Unharvest (2026) — Release Date, Cheats, Price & Requirements ...",url:"https://thegameextras.com/game/unharvest/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"thegameextras.com",hostname:"thegameextras.com",favicon:c,path:"  › games  › simulator  › unharvest"}}]},recipe:void 0,qa:void 0,book:void 0,rating:void 0,article:void 0,product:void 0,product_cluster:void 0,cluster_type:void 0,cluster:void 0,similar_pages:void 0,creative_work:{name:"Unharvest",thumbnail:{src:f,original:"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_720p/cod0c0.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true}},music_recording:void 0,review:void 0,software:void 0,content_type:void 0,side:void 0,descriptionLength:89,organization:{type:"organization",name:"TheGameExtras",url:void 0,thumbnail:void 0,contactPoints:[]}},{title:"Unharvest review: Reverse Farming Incremental Demo Impressions",url:"https://unharvest.wiki/reviews/unharvest-review",full_title:void 0,description:"According to the game&#x27;s official Steam store page, Unharvest is scheduled to release on \u003Cstrong>December 7, 2026\u003C/strong>.",page_age:"2026-10-20T12:28:01",profile:{name:"Unharvest Wiki",long_name:"unharvest.wiki"},language:"en",type:"search_result",subtype:"article",is_live:false,deep_results:void 0,meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.wiki",hostname:"unharvest.wiki",favicon:"https://imgs.searc