etloc:"youtube.com",hostname:"www.youtube.com",favicon:b,path:"› watch"},page_age:"2026-10-17T22:00:09",description:"Watch this Unharvest gameplay as I attempt to wither the world and infect every crop in sight.Unharvest is a unique reverse incremental game that flips the s...",thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/H_IabpS144bXWqyXIICpLSk1GZuiYEvgUnm9y4o3GeA/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnl0/aW1nLmNvbS92aS80/TS0wUUM1MWIyNC9t/YXhyZXNkZWZhdWx0/LmpwZw",original:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4M-0QC51b24/maxresdefault.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},publisher:void 0,age:"2 weeks ago",video:{author:void 0,creator:"River Films",duration:"24:27",views:void 0,thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/NUJ00Vo6kfMWp5wfvyLC9kJZ-i0TScAKZx03C1LMlQQ/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnl0/aW1nLmNvbS92aS80/TS0wUUM1MWIyNC9o/cWRlZmF1bHQuanBn",original:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4M-0QC51b24/hqdefault.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},tags:void 0,publisher:"YouTube",requires_subscription:void 0},profile:{name:"YouTube",url:"www.youtube.com",long_name:"youtube.com",img:b}},{title:"Unharvest Gameplay | ScorpionDev's new game - YouTube",url:"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xfh-pm9zgfc&vl=ml",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"youtube.com",hostname:"www.youtube.com",favicon:b,path:"› watch"},page_age:"2026-10-20T15:00:39",description:"Unharvest is a reverse-farming incremental game. Instead of growing crops, you wither them. Start with a single touch on a calm, living wheat field, then unl...",thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/bCuY9BWO2neWq1fakz1HpEOMA-_CrZHE4x0G6XhMEvo/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnl0/aW1nLmNvbS92aS9Y/ZmgtcG05emdmYy9t/YXhyZXNkZWZhdWx0/LmpwZw",original:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xfh-pm9zgfc/maxresdefault.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},publisher:void 0,age:"1 week ago",video:{author:void 0,creator:"WasntMyFault",duration:"30:11",views:void 0,thumbnail:{src:"https://imgs.search.brave.com/Eg6AcKnh3Nowz1HhdPBEN2z0Kmf-A07-t-aX0sfNBgw/rs:fit:200:200:1:0/g:ce/aHR0cHM6Ly9pLnl0/aW1nLmNvbS92aS9Y/ZmgtcG05emdmYy9o/cWRlZmF1bHQuanBn",original:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Xfh-pm9zgfc/hqdefault.jpg",is_tripadvisor:false,bo_serp_visible:true},tags:void 0,publisher:"YouTube",requires_subscription:void 0},profile:{name:"YouTube",url:"www.youtube.com",long_name:"youtube.com",img:b}}]},predicate_entity:void 0,infobox:void 0,faq:{type:"faq",results:[{question:"What is Unharvest?",answer:"\u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> is a single-player reverse-farming incremental game from developer SkorpionDev. Instead of growing crops, you spread plagues and drain life from the world around you, upgrading how far, how fast, and how widely the decay spreads.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"When does Unharvest release?",answer:"\u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> lists December 7, 2026 as the planned release date for the full version of \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong>. The full game is not yet available, but it can be added to a \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> wishlist.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"Is there a free Unharvest demo?",answer:"Yes. \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> Demo launched on \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> on October 7, 2026 as a free download with its own store page. It is the only publicly playable version of \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> right now.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"Will Unharvest run on my PC?",answer:"\u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> lists Windows 10 as its minimum operating system and Windows 11 as recommended on \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong>. Installing the free \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> demo from its own \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> page is the quickest way to see how the game runs on your machine.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"What platforms is Unharvest on?",answer:"\u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> is a Windows PC game distributed through \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong>. Both the full game and the \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> demo are single-player experiences with \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> Achievements, \u003Cstrong>Steam\u003C/strong> Cloud, and leaderboards.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}},{question:"How do Unharvest plague upgrades work?",answer:"The official \u003Cstrong>Unharvest\u003C/strong> description confirms plague upgrades grouped around spreading, speed, and reach. You improve those three areas to affect more of the environment as the world visibly and audibly withers.",title:"Unharvest Wiki - Guides, Upgrades & Demo",url:"https://www.unharvest.site/",meta_url:{scheme:"https",netloc:"unharvest.site",hostname:"www.unharvest.site",favicon:a,path:""}}]},discussions:void 0,summarizer:void 0,locations:void 0,recipes:void 0,images:void 0,chatllm:{key:"{\"v\":\"2\",\"query\":\"Unharvest Steam\",\"country\":\"us\",\"language\":\"en\",\"safesearch\":\"moderate\",\"results_hash\":\"335666ddabee50a96f2605e68e8a8373de362be5a0e6b35e4013b4dd655d0490\",\"experimental_inline_refs\":true}",query:"Unharvest Steam",conversation:"09bed5ff82632f006b24c6fff68b24a3f3f7",trigger:false,possible:true,context:[],entity_infobox_url:void 0,feature_callbacks:{bo_callback_lazy_load:"/a/feat